# Polivo Project Rule

- Read and follow the root `AGENTS.md`.
- Use the six files under `docs/context` as the canonical project context: `project-overview.md`, `architecture.md`, `code-standards.md`, `ui-context.md`, `ai-workflow-rules.md`, and `progress-tracker.md`.
- Read the current numbered guide under `docs/implementation` before changing code.
- Check `docs/context/progress-tracker.md` before starting work.
- Stay within the current phase and its necessary prerequisites.
- Record unresolved questions in the progress tracker rather than inventing business behavior.
- Update progress and report verification results before finishing.

Keep detailed architecture, coding standards, and UI requirements in their canonical files. Do not duplicate those specifications in this rule.
